!Full factory reset
!At the # prompt, type:
execute factoryreset

!Then you'll get a confirmation similar to:
!This operation will reset the system to factory default!
!Do you want to continue? (y/n)
!Type:
y

!===============================

Kung CLI command mismo para makita ang current/default IP address ng FortiGate interfaces, gamitin:

diagnose ip address list

Mas readable din:

show system interface

!===============================

Sa FortiGate, ang tinatawag nating SVI sa Cisco ay technically VLAN interface / VLAN sub-interface.

Step 1 — Tingnan muna ang physical interface names

Sa CLI:

show system interface

Hanapin natin ang physical port na gagamitin natin later para sa trunk. Hindi pa natin kailangan ikabit ngayon.

Halimbawa, sabihin nating gagamit tayo ng port3.

Step 2 — Create VLAN 10

Halimbawa:

VLAN ID: 10
Network: 192.168.10.0/24
Gateway: 192.168.10.1
DHCP:    192.168.10.100 - 192.168.10.200

CLI:

config system interface
    edit "VLAN10"
        set type vlan
        set interface "port3"
        set vlanid 10
        set ip 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0
        set allowaccess ping
    next
end

Pero huwag mo munang i-run kung hindi pa natin napipili ang physical interface. port3 ay example lamang.

Step 3 — DHCP Server para sa VLAN 10

Pag nagawa na ang VLAN interface:

config system dhcp server
    edit 10
        set interface "VLAN10"
        set default-gateway 192.168.10.1
        set netmask 255.255.255.0
        config ip-range
            edit 1
                set start-ip 192.168.10.100
                set end-ip 192.168.10.200
            next
        end
    next
end

Resulta:

VLAN 10
│
├── Gateway: 192.168.10.1
├── Network: 192.168.10.0/24
├── DHCP:    192.168.10.100-200
└── DHCP Server: FortiGate
Step 4 — Gawin natin sa ibang VLAN

Halimbawa:

VLAN	Network	Gateway	DHCP Range
10	192.168.10.0/24	192.168.10.1	.100–.200
20	192.168.20.0/24	192.168.20.1	.100–.200
30	192.168.30.0/24	192.168.30.1	.100–.200
40	192.168.40.0/24	192.168.40.1	.100–.200

So eventually magiging ganito:

                    FORTIGATE
                       │
                 ┌─────┴─────┐
                 │   port3   │
                 └─────┬─────┘
                       │
       ┌───────────────┼───────────────┐
       │               │               │
    VLAN10           VLAN20          VLAN30 ...
  192.168.10.1     192.168.20.1    192.168.30.1
      DHCP             DHCP            DHCP

Important: Since wala pa tayong Core connection, okay lang gawin muna ang VLAN interfaces. Pero kailangan natin ng 
parent physical interface (port1, port2, port3, etc.) bago tayo makapag-create ng VLAN interface.

👉 Next: Run mo muna:

show system interface

I-send mo ang output. Piliin natin kung anong port ang magiging parent interface ng lahat ng VLANs, 
tapos gagawin natin VLAN 10 → gateway → DHCP muna. Pag successful, saka natin i-batch ang remaining VLANs.
